--[[
	Expedition regions. Each region has `stages` stages (StagesPerRegion when omitted); the
	global index g of a stage (Regions.GlobalIndex) scales loot and first-clear rewards.
	Enemy waves are generated by Logic/BattleSim from this data so designers only tune
	numbers here.

	enemyLines: lines enemies are drawn from; bosses override at their stage. A boss's
	`firstClear` rewards are added to the stage's first-clear reward.
	levels / rarity: enemy level range across the region and enemy rarity range.

	depths (optional): a deeper band added in an update (Coral Depths, 1.1). Stages
	`from`..`stages` use the band's own unlock, levels, rarity, enemy lines and colours,
	and their global index starts at `indexFrom` and grows by `indexStep` per stage.
	Use Regions.Band(regionId, stage) instead of reading these fields directly.

	opensAt (optional, update 3.0 · Year Two): a new region every quarter. A region with
	`opensAt` stays closed to everyone until then (Regions.IsOpen), on top of its unlock
	level, so a region can ship early in an update and open on its date.
]]

